        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC50, Light Commercial or Residential Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDeltana's DC50 Door Closer is ideal for interior residential or light commercial doors weighing 30 to 75 pounds. It has an adjustable closing and latching speed. It is non-handed for easy installation. Available in 4 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Deltana DC50 Light Use Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated. R27405 UL LISTED 47V5</li>\r\n<li>Parallel mounting bracket / arm is included.</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Small body profile.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Interior Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Door Weight: 30 - 75 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: 2</li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC502.pdf?v=1691095379\" target=\"new\">Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC5-install.pdf?v=1691095317\" target=\"new\">Installation Instructions & Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
